WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.458
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:24.815 --> 00:00:27.680
Behold, I bring you tidings of great joy,

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:29.220
which shall be to all people.

00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:33.230
For onto you is born this day in the city of David, a Savior

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:36.290
Jesus Christ the Lord and this should be a sign on to you.

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:42.153
Linus is right.

00:00:42.153 --> 00:00:43.570
I won't let all this commercialism

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:45.968
ruin my Christmas.

00:00:45.968 --> 00:00:48.010
I'll take this little tree home, and decorate it,

00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:50.500
and I'll show them it really will work in our play.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:53.867
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:00.130 --> 00:01:01.250
First prize.

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:09.910
Oh, well, this commercial dog is not going to ruin my Christmas.

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:13.114
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:21.880
I've killed it.

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:24.550
Oh, everything I touch gets ruined.

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:27.938
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:38.840
I never thought it was such a bad little tree.

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:43.950
It's not bad at all really.

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:45.750
Maybe it just needs a little love.

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:48.960
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:02.820
Charlie Brown is a blockhead, but he did get a nice tree.

